pinn-swe-reflections-lab

This project contains modified and reorganized code derived from:

Testing_PINNs
https://github.com/KubilayDemir/Testing_PINNs

The original project is associated with the publication:

Demir, K. T.; Logemann, K.; Greenberg, D. S.
Closed-Boundary Reflections of Shallow Water Waves as an Open Challenge
for Physics-Informed Neural Networks.
Mathematics 2024, 12(21), 3315.
https://doi.org/10.3390/math12213315

Modifications in this repository include repository restructuring, reference-solution
preprocessing utilities, experiment runners, and additional PINN training strategies,
including RAD, RAR-D, gPINN-style losses and precision-control
experiments.

Unless otherwise stated, modifications are provided under the Apache License 2.0.